+  comment
+    2026-10-13: every @id / url / BreadcrumbList item uses the primary-domain
+    canonical, the same rule layout/theme.liquid applies to <link rel=canonical>
+    and meta-tags.liquid to og:url. Before, a request served on
+    www.slimhome.nl, www.bestezaklampen.nl or the myshopify domain emitted
+    entity ids and breadcrumb items on that host, so the JSON-LD contradicted
+    the canonical tag.
+  endcomment
+  assign sd_canonical = canonical_url
+  if request.origin != shop.url
+    assign sd_canonical = canonical_url | replace_first: request.origin, shop.url
+  endif
+
