+      2026-10-13: the return policy applies to every country the store ships
+      to (zone 1 + zone 2), not only the home zone, so BE/DE/FR/ES offers no
+      longer lack return terms. returnFees mirrors the refund policy: the
+      customer pays return shipping unless the item is defective or wrong.
